      "caption": "⚾ Great coaching starts with great reps.\n\nThe ProVelocity Bat helps coaches run more effective drills — whether working solo or with players — by reinforcing proper mechanics, timing, \nand bat speed in every swing.\n\n✅ Upgrade every drill instantly\n✅ Reinforce clean mechanics\n✅ Build bat speed and connection\n\n💥 Better drills create better hitters.",
      "transcript": "Posture is everything. Do you know what posture means? Yeah. What's posture? Like how you stand. How you stand, how you... everything, right? That's good. In hitting, this right here, good posture, you're sitting already right here. Bad. The reason why it's bad is because my body is, it's just straight up, right? Think of my, you know what spine is? Yeah. Think of my spine as just like this, straight. When you hit the baseball, you want to have a posture somewhat like this so you're able to connect. Your posture will be a little more straight up when the ball is a little higher. You have to level out. But as that ball gets lower, what does my posture do? It goes with it. See my spine? Look. Yeah. It goes with it. Make sense? Yeah. So I want you to focus on your posture and holding your posture. This is what I'm going to have you do. We're going to hit it. One, two, three, step diagonally. What's the importance of this? Why are we doing this? Keep your balance. Good. So you're in front of the ball. Good. Also, it teaches you to hit off your backside. So look, if I'm not, if I can't do that, pulling off. Or if I'm going like this and I'm falling this way, I'm out in front. If I hit off my backside, hold for three, take a step, it teaches me that I'm using my backside. Got it? Yeah. Let's try this right here. All I want you to do, you can choke up a bit. It's a little heavy for you. Think of it as like a rod. Choke up a little bit. Feel the click. Feel the weight. Nothing changes. Hold. Go for it. Hold. One, two, three, take a step. Let's go. Load. Hold. One, two, three. Yeah. Again, how old are you? Eleven. Eleven years old. How many players at eleven years old really understand how to use their backside? Not a lot. Most of them will hit like this. Yeah. But you're going. With control. Got it? Yeah. Load. Hold. One, two, three. That's what I'm talking about. Load. Hold. One, two. Get out of there. Good. Load. One, two. That's your best one. Get out of there. Good. Load. One, two, three. Four. Two half. Five base, three fourth. Go. That's what I'm talking about. Cool? Yeah. Reset, dude.",
